==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 12~15.33 seconds<sup>360f~460f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*7 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Aku enemies at this point in the game would normally be scary, but [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] makes quick work of them with the help of [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]]. Outside of that, use [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] to expedite the Aku-killing process. Once you manage to isolate Dark Emperor Nyandam, start swarming him with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cats]] to claim your easy victory before you start running low on cash.

